  Open FIGGY BAR. Items discussed include Micromint 8051 board and chipforth,
                  the target and PROM configuration,the ANS approach to meta,
                  building Forth kernels from scratch, F-PC, BBL, Zen, Pygmy.
Minutes:
<D.RUFFER> is here.
<[jax@well] FIGCHAPTERS> Hi Dennis, Gary.
<[Gary] GARY-S> Open BAR - RYO tonite
