<[jax@well] FIGCHAPTERS> Tell me details (if you can)!
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> the Evaluation board that we had been using...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> allowed us to add a PROM and bypass their monitor...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> but their latest board does not...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> they also strongly urged us not to offer their...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> evaluation boards for sale, since they will update them...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> at any time and they do not test them...
<D.MARTINDAL1> is here.
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> so we went to the source, MicroMint, who had the
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> original board, with Basic on it...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> we can still add our own PROM and bypass theirs...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> so everyone is happy again.
<[jax@well] FIGCHAPTERS> Aha, so micromint is where yo wants a 8051 board from 
if you are just dinking?
<[Gary] GARY-S> post an address
