<[Deano] D.MARTINDAL1> masm
<[Deano] D.MARTINDAL1> and, of course, working on my MSDOS forth
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> have you looked at the ones available here?
<[Gary] GARY-S> rolling your own there too - I'm impressed
