<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> but it is ANS compatable (before it is a standard)
<[Gary] GARY-S> Roedy Green (BBL) Frank Sergeant (Pygmy) and Martin Tracy (Zen) 
are also all available - ain't that nice ?
<[Deano] D.MARTINDAL1> is he the one that wrote that article in EMBEDDED 
SYSTEMS PROGRAMMING
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> yes, the same guy
<[Deano] D.MARTINDAL1> about using masm to desigforth
<[Gary] GARY-S> You may be thinking also of Jax - Jack Woehr - just left
